meta {
  name: Numbers · Patch messaging config
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v2.2/numbers/:number/messaging
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  number: <number>
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
{
  "routeOut": 0,
  "routeIn": 1234
}
}

docs {
**Update inbound or outbound routing**
At least one of routeIn / routeOut must be present. routeIn must be a numbers_sms row id owned by the authenticated account, or 0 to detach. routeOut must be 0 (outbound off) or the route the number is enabled on; to move a number to another campaign or messaging path use PUT /v2.2/numbers/{number}/messaging-campaign.

OperationId: `numbersMessagingPatch`
}
